(7106646, 1083925, 18367, '<td valign="top">Oh my... now this is a very nice image and reminiscent of what one would expect to see in the New England States.<br/> <br/>A stunning image that makes my entry pale by comparison and I fully expect to see this on the front page at the end of the voting process.<br/> <br/>Very nicely done.</td>', 'Oh my... now this is a very nice image and reminiscent of what one would expect to see in the New England States. A stunning image that makes my entry pale by comparison and I fully expect to see this on the front page at the end of the voting process. Very nicely done.', '2013-09-25 01:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7106656, 1083600, 15511, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail.</td>', 'Very nice detail.', '2013-09-25 01:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7106660, 1083813, 18367, '<td valign="top">I look at this image and could swear that I have seen this very barn somewhere.  The leading lines, presence of the fog and what I assume is the morning light... all of these contribute to making this a very appealing image and is definitely one of the better images I have seen in this challenge.<br/> <br/>The very best of luck to you.</td>', 'I look at this image and could swear that I have seen this very barn somewhere.  The leading lines, presence of the fog and what I assume is the morning light... all of these contribute to making this a very appealing image and is definitely one of the better images I have seen in this challenge. The very best of luck to you.', '2013-09-25 01:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7106661, 1083813, 15511, '<td valign="top">The mix of colors and mist is wonderful. A remarkable image.</td>', 'The mix of colors and mist is wonderful. A remarkable image.', '2013-09-25 01:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
