(7106698, 1083836, 82830, '<td valign="top">Such interesting photo. I like the sky and it is framed very well. I think the picture suffers from lighting. The light is a little harsh on the bottom right corner and the sky is very dull. A little more editing will make this one great. It might even work as B&amp;W with more contrast and selective highlights. Great work.</td>', 'Such interesting photo. I like the sky and it is framed very well. I think the picture suffers from lighting. The light is a little harsh on the bottom right corner and the sky is very dull. A little more editing will make this one great. It might even work as B&W with more contrast and selective highlights. Great work.', '2013-09-25 04:03:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7106699, 1083582, 82830, '<td valign="top">Good perspective. Interesting picture even if the sky was not cooperating.</td>', 'Good perspective. Interesting picture even if the sky was not cooperating.', '2013-09-25 04:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
