(7106839, 1083934, 18367, '<td valign="top">I would wager that this photo was taken in Australia. Not a bad image, but the presence of the partial tree and cow on the left detract from the overall image.  The bland sky and the lack of crispness of the photo are also factors that have a negative impact on the overall appeal of the image.  <br/> <br/>The very best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'I would wager that this photo was taken in Australia. Not a bad image, but the presence of the partial tree and cow on the left detract from the overall image.  The bland sky and the lack of crispness of the photo are also factors that have a negative impact on the overall appeal of the image.   The very best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2013-09-25 12:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
