(7107323, 1083501, 18367, '<td valign="top">This challenge has revealed yet another gem.  Anyone who knows me has an appreciation of just how much I love barns and rural landscapes.<br/> <br/>A very nice image and it is somewhat sad that the trees had not yet fully changed colours as that would have added even more to what is already a beautiful image.<br/> <br/>The very best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'This challenge has revealed yet another gem.  Anyone who knows me has an appreciation of just how much I love barns and rural landscapes. A very nice image and it is somewhat sad that the trees had not yet fully changed colours as that would have added even more to what is already a beautiful image. The very best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2013-09-26 21:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7107324, 1083982, 18367, '<td valign="top">I have no idea just how you managed to give this image such a hazy hue or how you arrived at the colours in the trees, but I do marvel at the end product.<br/> <br/>Very nicely done and I eagerly await the results of the voting as I do believe this should do very well in the challenge.<br/> <br/>The very best of luck to you.</td>', 'I have no idea just how you managed to give this image such a hazy hue or how you arrived at the colours in the trees, but I do marvel at the end product. Very nicely done and I eagerly await the results of the voting as I do believe this should do very well in the challenge. The very best of luck to you.', '2013-09-26 21:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
