(7108729, 1083697, 67152, '<td valign="top">nice use of muted tones to give a nostalgic feel</td>', 'nice use of muted tones to give a nostalgic feel', '2013-09-30 10:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7108878, 1083812, 98141, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture of reflections, particularly the swans'' necks. Nice placement of the swans in the composition and their white stands out great against the darkness of the water. Would love to spend a day here!</td>', 'Beautiful capture of reflections, particularly the swans'' necks. Nice placement of the swans in the composition and their white stands out great against the darkness of the water. Would love to spend a day here!', '2013-09-30 16:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7108879, 1083969, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love the brightness of this shot, highlighting the sun and heat over the land on this sunny day. Nice placement of the horse in the frame and good balance between sky and land/thirds. I find the widescreen bars a bit distracting.</td>', 'I love the brightness of this shot, highlighting the sun and heat over the land on this sunny day. Nice placement of the horse in the frame and good balance between sky and land/thirds. I find the widescreen bars a bit distracting.', '2013-09-30 16:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7108881, 1083884, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love the subject matter, grassy/mossy rocks feel present and ancient at the same time to me. I find this photo feels a bit flat -- not a lot of depth of field to separate the up front rocks from the mountain in the back.</td>', 'I love the subject matter, grassy/mossy rocks feel present and ancient at the same time to me. I find this photo feels a bit flat -- not a lot of depth of field to separate the up front rocks from the mountain in the back.', '2013-09-30 16:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7108885, 1083795, 98141, '<td valign="top">YELLOW! I tend to be fairly partial to square crops, but I feel in this one that it takes away from the expanse of the rural countryside, which are in part appealing (at least, to me) because they are so much more vast than the visually cramped city. Love the sheep and the colors.</td>', 'YELLOW! I tend to be fairly partial to square crops, but I feel in this one that it takes away from the expanse of the rural countryside, which are in part appealing (at least, to me) because they are so much more vast than the visually cramped city. Love the sheep and the colors.', '2013-09-30 16:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7108890, 1083758, 98141, '<td valign="top">The sky is truly the radiant protagonist of this photograph, but it doesn''t get much of the stage. I would love to see it get more of the frame and leave out so much of the dark ground. Great timing with the sun peaking right over the edge of the home. Great colors.</td>', 'The sky is truly the radiant protagonist of this photograph, but it doesn''t get much of the stage. I would love to see it get more of the frame and leave out so much of the dark ground. Great timing with the sun peaking right over the edge of the home. Great colors.', '2013-09-30 16:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7108893, 1083762, 98141, '<td valign="top">Such a very lovely green, the perfect country color for after the rains. The big, beautiful barn takes center stage here and it is crisp and clear in the image.</td>', 'Such a very lovely green, the perfect country color for after the rains. The big, beautiful barn takes center stage here and it is crisp and clear in the image.', '2013-09-30 16:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7108897, 1083801, 98141, '<td valign="top">Now this is how you photograph the sun in the countryside! Very beautiful image, evokes emotion and tells a story. The scope feels right, the composition is lovely, there is not too much land and the sky is allowed to reign. Sharp and clear as well. Excellent.</td>', 'Now this is how you photograph the sun in the countryside! Very beautiful image, evokes emotion and tells a story. The scope feels right, the composition is lovely, there is not too much land and the sky is allowed to reign. Sharp and clear as well. Excellent.', '2013-09-30 16:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7108898, 1083852, 98141, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and execution. I love the way the sheep stands out against the background, clear and crisp without taking away from the majesty of the landscape.</td>', 'Wonderful composition and execution. I love the way the sheep stands out against the background, clear and crisp without taking away from the majesty of the landscape.', '2013-09-30 16:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7108899, 1083639, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the use of water to get a reflection, and the trees are a lovely subject. The composition feels a little awkward, with the edge of the fountain being visible but not really included in the shot. I don''t feel like there''s a story being told here or even a main subject of the photo.</td>', 'I like the use of water to get a reflection, and the trees are a lovely subject. The composition feels a little awkward, with the edge of the fountain being visible but not really included in the shot. I don''t feel like there''s a story being told here or even a main subject of the photo.', '2013-09-30 16:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7108900, 1083696, 63244, '<td valign="top">Great detail! These cows are so funny! :)</td>', 'Great detail! These cows are so funny! :)', '2013-09-30 16:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7108901, 1083600, 63244, '<td valign="top">Colors are stunning!</td>', 'Colors are stunning!', '2013-09-30 17:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7108902, 1083703, 98141, '<td valign="top">While there is a clear subject here, the girl, both because she is the only human in the shot and it''s the title of the photo, I don''t feel like the character gets to shine here. The dress looks as though it''s caught on the fence and there is nothing that helps the character to stand out against the background of the barn -- I think greater DOF or alternate lighting could help her really pop. Love the idea of it.</td>', 'While there is a clear subject here, the girl, both because she is the only human in the shot and it''s the title of the photo, I don''t feel like the character gets to shine here. The dress looks as though it''s caught on the fence and there is nothing that helps the character to stand out against the background of the barn -- I think greater DOF or alternate lighting could help her really pop. Love the idea of it.', '2013-09-30 17:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7108903, 1083696, 98141, '<td valign="top">I understand that it''s his little frown that is the point of this shot, but I find myself staring at his eyes in any case and wishing they were a bit sharper (or perhaps not included in the crop?). I love his snotty little whiskers, what a cutie.</td>', 'I understand that it''s his little frown that is the point of this shot, but I find myself staring at his eyes in any case and wishing they were a bit sharper (or perhaps not included in the crop?). I love his snotty little whiskers, what a cutie.', '2013-09-30 17:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7108906, 1083841, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love the subject matter and the pops of practically neon green--I wish the angle were a little more out-of-the-box, this feels pretty traditional to me and I think the smallness of the toys could be highlighted better (or perhaps they could have been made to feel large with a lower angle, which would be more unique).</td>', 'I love the subject matter and the pops of practically neon green--I wish the angle were a little more out-of-the-box, this feels pretty traditional to me and I think the smallness of the toys could be highlighted better (or perhaps they could have been made to feel large with a lower angle, which would be more unique).', '2013-09-30 17:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7108907, 1083714, 63244, '<td valign="top">Windmills can be so fascinating, especially rusty ones! Good find.<br/>My take is: Your subject is a target (dead center). A completely different perspective could help this be more interesting. Get in closer and down low maybe. Mind your power lines. :)  There is no interest in the sky (no clouds). You cannot control the clouds, but you can choose when you go shoot. :) Overall the photo feels very flat to me. Hitting it with some contrast would be an idea. I would like to see you reshoot this on a day with better sky, perhaps during the golden hour or early morning and see what you can do with it.</td>', 'Windmills can be so fascinating, especially rusty ones! Good find.My take is: Your subject is a target (dead center). A completely different perspective could help this be more interesting. Get in closer and down low maybe. Mind your power lines. :)  There is no interest in the sky (no clouds). You cannot control the clouds, but you can choose when you go shoot. :) Overall the photo feels very flat to me. Hitting it with some contrast would be an idea. I would like to see you reshoot this on a day with better sky, perhaps during the golden hour or early morning and see what you can do with it.', '2013-09-30 17:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7108908, 1083697, 98141, '<td valign="top">Feels very dreary, but that is a story too, isn''t it? I like the composition and the decision to emphasize the texture of everything with the editing -- even the clouds look rough and tired, like living on the edge of modernity truly is the hard life.</td>', 'Feels very dreary, but that is a story too, isn''t it? I like the composition and the decision to emphasize the texture of everything with the editing -- even the clouds look rough and tired, like living on the edge of modernity truly is the hard life.', '2013-09-30 17:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7108909, 1083908, 98141, '<td valign="top">Different than anything I''ve seen so far in the challenge, so bonus points for that, but I''m not sure I get it.</td>', 'Different than anything I''ve seen so far in the challenge, so bonus points for that, but I''m not sure I get it.', '2013-09-30 17:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7108910, 1083889, 63244, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scenery. Looks to be shot mid day! Perhaps a bit early or later would give this a more inviting feel.</td>', 'Beautiful scenery. Looks to be shot mid day! Perhaps a bit early or later would give this a more inviting feel.', '2013-09-30 17:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7108911, 1083813, 98141, '<td valign="top">Stunning colors and clarity, emphasized by the mist obscuring the background. Beautiful subject matter. Interesting decision to leave in the pavement--even countryside these days has roads it seems. I like the contrast between that modern amenity and the idyllic history of the barn and farm.</td>', 'Stunning colors and clarity, emphasized by the mist obscuring the background. Beautiful subject matter. Interesting decision to leave in the pavement--even countryside these days has roads it seems. I like the contrast between that modern amenity and the idyllic history of the barn and farm.', '2013-09-30 17:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7108912, 1083791, 63244, '<td valign="top">I like this! Thank you for doing this portrait and not landscape! It really shows off the natural layering!</td>', 'I like this! Thank you for doing this portrait and not landscape! It really shows off the natural layering!', '2013-09-30 17:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7108913, 1083811, 63244, '<td valign="top">This is the kind of stuff I just love. Nicely done!</td>', 'This is the kind of stuff I just love. Nicely done!', '2013-09-30 17:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
