(7109642, 1083874, 135744, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by skewsme:</b></div><hr/><i> congrats...very cute - but hard to believe that''s a 1/40s exposure unless you used a tripod and they''re stuffed ;-) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Well spotted! I did indeed use a tripod that morning as I was using my new Canon 10-22 lens and thought as it did not have Image Stabilisation it would need a helping hand to keep things steady.</td>', 'Originally posted by skewsme: congrats...very cute - but hard to believe that''s a 1/40s exposure unless you used a tripod and they''re stuffed ;-)   Well spotted! I did indeed use a tripod that morning as I was using my new Canon 10-22 lens and thought as it did not have Image Stabilisation it would need a helping hand to keep things steady.', '2013-10-02 05:21:32.000000', NULL, 0),
