(7109695, 1083478, 67152, '<td valign="top">Thank you very much for all the kind words and comments and votes on my entry.  Very pleased with the reception this image received, and shocked to see a ribbon, considering the quality of the entries.  I have not been around DPC for a while, but am pleased to see it alive and kicking!<br/> <br/>It was a pleasure to vote and comment on this challenge, with such an assortment of wonderful work. Well done. <br/> <br/>Regards,<br/>Peter</td>', 'Thank you very much for all the kind words and comments and votes on my entry.  Very pleased with the reception this image received, and shocked to see a ribbon, considering the quality of the entries.  I have not been around DPC for a while, but am pleased to see it alive and kicking! It was a pleasure to vote and comment on this challenge, with such an assortment of wonderful work. Well done.  Regards,Peter', '2013-10-02 08:52:17.000000', NULL, 0),
