(7111419, 1083874, 147314, '<td valign="top">Although I love the image (as any of your animal images), I didn''t consider this one to be 100% DMC, it''s more about the animals than about a farm or countryside (but maybe that is my narrow-minded way of thinking) and therefore I only gave you a 5. <br/>But please accept my congratulations for your Yellow ribbon.</td>', 'Although I love the image (as any of your animal images), I didn''t consider this one to be 100% DMC, it''s more about the animals than about a farm or countryside (but maybe that is my narrow-minded way of thinking) and therefore I only gave you a 5. But please accept my congratulations for your Yellow ribbon.', '2013-10-05 12:10:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(7112173, 1083874, 135744, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Kroburg:</b></div><hr/><i> Although I love the image (as any of your animal images), I didn''t consider this one to be 100% DMC, it''s more about the animals than about a farm or countryside (but maybe that is my narrow-minded way of thinking) and therefore I only gave you a 5. <br/>But please accept my congratulations for your Yellow ribbon. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I did have concerns about that too but I was persuaded by others that the photo would be a perfect fit so I took the risk. I understand your views on this:)</td>', 'Originally posted by Kroburg: Although I love the image (as any of your animal images), I didn''t consider this one to be 100% DMC, it''s more about the animals than about a farm or countryside (but maybe that is my narrow-minded way of thinking) and therefore I only gave you a 5. But please accept my congratulations for your Yellow ribbon.   I did have concerns about that too but I was persuaded by others that the photo would be a perfect fit so I took the risk. I understand your views on this:)', '2013-10-07 06:47:36.000000', NULL, 0),
