(7635099, 1083925, 67258, '<td valign="top">An old one, but so worth revisiting.  I love that the landscape is so similar, but at the same time so different to Britain''s.  It''s the human elements that mark it out - the wooden buildings against our stone, the simple wooden rail against our hedges or stone walls.  perfectly composed.</td>', 'An old one, but so worth revisiting.  I love that the landscape is so similar, but at the same time so different to Britain''s.  It''s the human elements that mark it out - the wooden buildings against our stone, the simple wooden rail against our hedges or stone walls.  perfectly composed.', '2019-07-15 12:23:23.000000', NULL, 0);
